  "id": "response-learning",
  "term": "response learning",
  "definition": "Response learning is learning the connection between a stimulus and the response it predicts or requires, rather than learning the stimulus’s meaning or other features. In the source context, it refers to learning response contingencies that can strongly influence performance.",
